    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑quarter tank fuel regulation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Reduce the fuel level to approximately 25 % of tank capacity. This minimizes weight, reduces the risk of spillage, and complies with safety regulations for bike transport through bus and rail corridors. Note the exact volume in the audit sheet and seal the fuel cap with a tamper‑evident sticker.</p>
