    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag management:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the bike is being shipped on a route that utilizes FASTag toll plazas (common for long‑distance bus bike parcel services), ensure the tag is deactivated or transferred to the carrier’s account. Record the FASTag number and attach a screenshot of the deactivation confirmation to the shipment file.</p>
